<h3 class="page-title back-button security-level mb40">
	<div title="Nivel de seguridad 1" class="level1"></div>
	<span class="title">Accreditation of a Social Security number</span>
	<a class="btn btn-sml only-lrg" href="javascript:history.back()" title="Go back">&lt; Go back</a> 
	
</h3> 




	<p class="page-subtitle">With this service you can consult your Social Security Number-NUSS or Affiliation number-NAF, in addition to viewing, saving or printing a report identifying you as a taxpayer in your relations with the Social Security.</p>










  
	<p class="pre-content"> 
		To access this service check you have the necessary
		<a href="/wps/portal/sede/sede/Inicio/RequisitosTecnicos" title="Check the technical requirements">
			technical requirements.
		</a> 
		 
	</p>
	
